From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 01:51:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3550/3799] soh: rename func_80B515C4 -> EnZl2_SetupAction25Alt

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: a second entry into action 25, taken from the running-Zelda cue dispatch rather than the walking one
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
index da1426b21..e7a1695cb 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl2/z_en_zl2.c
@@ -1300,7 +1300,8 @@ void func_80B5154C(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80B515C4(EnZl2* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B515C4: a second entry into action 25, taken from the running-Zelda cue dispatch rather than the walking one
+void EnZl2_SetupAction25Alt(EnZl2* this) {
     this->action = 25;
     this->drawConfig = 0;
     this->actor.shape.shadowAlpha = 0;
@@ -1404,7 +1405,7 @@ void func_80B51948(EnZl2* this, PlayState* play) {
         if (newAction != unk_240) {
             switch (newAction) {
                 case 1:
-                    func_80B515C4(this);
+                    EnZl2_SetupAction25Alt(this);  // was func_80B515C4 [LLM:HIGH]
                     break;
                 case 2:
                     EnZl2_SetupAction26(this, play);  // was func_80B515D8 [LLM:HIGH]
